# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for `make test-tsan`.
# Keep every entry narrow and explain why it is safe.

# miniaudio 0.11.23 (also unchanged in upstream 0.11.26): ma_sound_set_volume
# stores the gainer's float master volume with a plain write while the device
# thread reads it in ma_gainer_process_pcm_frames. A float store is not torn
# on supported targets; the worst case is one period played at the old
# volume. Remove this when miniaudio makes masterVolume atomic.
race:ma_gainer_set_master_volume
